     <p>   
        <u>Create new Coverage Rule:</u>
         <br /><br /> Name   : &nbsp; <input id="name" name="name" type="text" value="" /> (Short descriptive rule name)
        <br /><br />  Select Table: 
        <!--<select id="ind_col" name="col" style="width:auto" onchange="GenSubmitFormAction('addForm','@Url.Action("CreateCoverageRules", "CyclePlanDB")')">-->
