        <br /><br />Ports    : <input id="ports" name="ports" type="text" value="PA,PB,PC,PD" /> (comma delimited)
        <br /><br />Lanes    : <input id="lanes" name="lanes" type="text" value="L0,L1,L2,L3" /> (comma delimited)
        <br /><br />Trials   : <input id="trials" name="trials" type="text" value="1" /> (number, default is 1)
